	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Annum novum iam imminentem, domine et frater in Christo charissime, tibi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tuisque quam felicissimum precor a deo patre per dominum nostrum Iesum Christum; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>simul stręnarum nomine aureos 8 more mihi solito tibi dono mitto, quos boni <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>consulas rogo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Gratias tibi ago, quod mecum pleraque scripta de <placeName ref="l832">Gallię</placeName> statu communicast<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>i; eadem tibi nunc remitto.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Citius remittere et quidem commode non <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>potui.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Placuit inprimis <placeName ref="l272">Rupellensium</placeName> responsum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">De nostrarum rerum statu <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quando ex <persName>Müllero</persName>, qui hasce ad te fert, praesens omnia cognoscere potes, praeter ea, quae paginę <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>adiectę inscripta cernis, non censui pluribus ad te scribendum esse.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In <persName>Müllero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>deprehendi, quae in eo laudas.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ago tibi gratias, quod mei curam gesseris etiam hac <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>in re.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Adiunxi ipsum filio meo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nunc mitto ipsum <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>prout ista et cęteras ex ipso <persName>Müllero</persName> cognoscere poteris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Exultant papistę <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>apud nos passim non minus quam apud vos; spero tamen in ipsos quadraturum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>proverbium tritum, <foreign xml:lang="de">das einer die haut verkaufft, ehe er den beren <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>gesechen hatt.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Expectamus, quid tot passim conventus prolaturi sint: <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l21">Badenę</placeName>, electorum <placeName ref="l267">Colonię</placeName>, principum <placeName ref="l337">Neumburgi</placeName>, <placeName ref="l619">Bavari</placeName> <placeName ref="l276">Lanshutti</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandi</persName>, <persName ref="p18538">Caroli</persName>, Cęsaris in suis cuiusque ditionibus, tum conventus nuper <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>elapsus <placeName ref="l619">Bavari</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1725">Saltzburgensis</placeName>, <persName ref="p18538">Caroli</persName> et <persName ref="p18477">Fredinandi</persName>, <placeName ref="l2472">Polonorum</placeName> item <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et omnium passim gentium sursum deorsumque cursitatio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Datum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l3369">Bocksperg</placeName> 23. decembris anno 72.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>D. <persName ref="p1586">Francisci Hotomanni</persName> calamitates mihi dolent; mitto ad te aureos <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>praeter superiores 8, quos meo nomine, cum nuntium commodum habere potes, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>illi dono mittas, rogo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>R[everentiae] t[uae] observantissimus <persName ref="p3740">Georgius a Stetten</persName>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Venerando, pio atque erudito domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> antistiti fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et amico suo colendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
